<html lang="en">
<head><title>Plugin conflict</title></head>
<body style="${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE}">
Plugin Conflict<br>
<ul>
    <li><b>Database Navigator</b> - third-party plugin</li>
    <li><b>Database Tools and SQL</b> - JetBrains bundled plugin</li>
</ul>
Both <u>Database Navigator</u> (DBN) and
the <u>Database Tools and SQL</u> plugins provide very similar database functionality.
Having both plugins installed can lead to an ambiguous and sometimes conflicting user experience. <u>Disable one of them to avoid conflicts.</u><br><br>

<u>Database Navigator</u> is not a complementary product to, and is not integrated with, the bundled database tool.
This plugin may not be needed when fully featured database support is already available.

<br><br>
Select one of the options below to continue.
<br>
<br>
</body>
</html>

